 - `shipments.create_shipment(customer_id, weight_kg, zone)`: book a shipment
 - `shipments.get_shipment(shipment_id)`: fetch one shipment
+- `shipments.split_shipment(shipment_id, weights)`: replace a shipment in status "created" with one new shipment per weight (same customer and zone), returned in the order of `weights`; the original becomes "split". Weights must be positive and sum to the original weight. Errors: `E_NOT_FOUND`, `E_BAD_STATE`, `E_BAD_WEIGHT`, `E_BAD_INPUT` (empty list)
 
